#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4853
msgid ""
"Describe the slides you want to create. For example: \"A 5-slide overview "
"of renewable energy\" or \"An introduction to our team\"."
msgstr ""
"Déan cur síos ar na sleamhnáin is mian leat a chruthú. Mar shampla: "
"\"Forbhreathnú 5 shleamhnán ar fhuinneamh in-athnuaite\" nó \"Réamhrá dár "
"bhfoireann\"."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4861
msgid ""
"Describe the image you want to generate. For example: \"A watercolour of a "
"mountain lake at sunrise\"."
msgstr ""
"Déan cur síos ar an íomhá is mian leat a ghiniúint. Mar shampla: \"Pictiúr "
"uiscedhatha de loch sléibhe ag éirí na gréine\"."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4868
msgid "Write speaker notes for the current slide."
msgstr "Scríobh nótaí cainte don sleamhnán reatha."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4901
msgid ""
"Describe what formula you need. For example: \"Calculate the average of "
"column B\" or \"Sum all values where column A is greater than 100\"."
msgstr ""
"Déan cur síos ar an bhfoirmle atá uait. Mar shampla: \"Ríomh meán cholún B\" "
"nó \"Suimigh na luachanna uile ina bhfuil colún A níos mó ná 100\"."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4911
msgid ""
"Read row numbers from the \"Row\" column — do not count or estimate row "
"positions."
msgstr ""
"Léigh uimhreacha na sraitheanna ón gcolún \"Ró\" — ná déan suíomhanna na "
"sraitheanna a chomhaireamh ná a mheas."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4915
msgid ""
"To identify a cell's column, match the value to the column letter in the "
"header row — do not guess."
msgstr ""
"Chun colún cille a aithint, meaitseáil an luach leis an litir cholúin sa ró "
"ceanntásca — ná buille faoi thuairim."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4919
msgid ""
"Reference a cell by combining its column header with the row number (e.g., "
"column B + row 2 = B2)."
msgstr ""
"Déan tagairt do chill trí cheanntásc a colúin a chomhcheangal le huimhir an "
"ró (m.sh., colún B + ró 2 = B2)."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4923
msgid ""
"The table shows what each cell displays. The \"Formulas:\" list below it "
"gives the formula of each cell that has one."
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn an tábla cad a thaispeánann gach cill. Tugann an liosta "
"\"Foirmlí:\" thíos air sin an fhoirmle do gach cill a bhfuil ceann aici."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4926
msgid ""
"When referencing specific cells, format each cell as a clickable link: [B2]"
"(cell://B2)."
msgstr ""
"Agus tú ag tagairt do chealla sonracha, formáidigh gach cill mar nasc "
"inchliceáilte: [B2](cell://B2)."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4932
msgid "Sanity check the following spreadsheet data."
msgstr "Seiceáil go ciallmhar na sonraí scarbhileog seo a leanas."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4933
msgid "Please analyze this data for:"
msgstr "Déan anailís ar na sonraí seo le haghaidh:"

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4937
msgid ""
"Benford's Law violations — check if leading digit distribution of numeric "
"values deviates significantly from the expected distribution, which may "
"suggest data manipulation."
msgstr ""
"Sáruithe ar Dhlí Benford — seiceáil an bhfuil dáileadh na ndigit tosaigh de "
"luachanna uimhriúla ag diall go suntasach ón dáileadh ionchais, rud a "
"d'fhéadfadh a thabhairt le fios go bhfuil ionramháil sonraí ann."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4943
msgid ""
"Statistical outliers — identify values that deviate significantly from "
"their column or group."
msgstr ""
"Eiseachtaigh staitistiúla — aithnigh luachanna a imríonn go suntasach óna "
"gcolún nó óna ngrúpa."

#: src/control/Control.AIChatSidebar.ts:4949
msgid ""
"General anomalies — suspicious patterns, unexpected duplicates, "
"inconsistencies, or formatting issues."
msgstr ""
"Neamhrialtachtaí ginearálta — patrúin amhrasacha, dúblaigh gan choinne, "
"neamhréireachtaí, nó fadhbanna formáidithe."

